599	Qwen2.5-7B & $-$12.38 & $-$20.53 & $-$14.52 & $\mathbf{-24.97}$ & Hill (0.77) \\
600	Gemma-2 9B & $\mathbf{17.35}$ & 18.89 & 20.01 & 18.96 & Constant (0.39) \\
