    - {round: 10, reviewers: "R1,R2", note: "R2-W1 re-raises ARC PPP. R1 corrects: PPP=0.003 IS in main text §5.5. R1-W3 adds: MMLU PPP=0.16-0.25 only in Appendix K, not in main text—this is the bigger gap. Both agree MMLU PPP should be reported in main text."}
    - {round: 11, reviewers: "", note: "本轮未直接提及（fresh review）。"}
  action_items:
